            "sid": "ZEC 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Speak unto all the people of the land, and to the priests, saying, When ye fasted and mourned in the fifth and seventh",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "month",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.7.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.7.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", even those seventy years, did ye at all fast unto me,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.7.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.7.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to me?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when ye did eat, and when ye did drink, did not ye eat",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for yourselves",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.7.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.7.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and drink",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for yourselves",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.7.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.7.6"
